msgid "Quarkus attempts to automatically define a persistence unit when the Hibernate ORM extension is enabled, a default datasource is defined, and there are mapped entities. This build item represents the decision about creating such an implied persistence unit; it's modelled as a BuildItem so that other extensions can be aware of such a persistence unit being defined (e.g. Hibernate Reactive needs to know)."
